ve strikes on enemy positions marked on the mini-map.\n* **Chopper Gunners / VTOLs:** Call in air support that you can either pilot or let automatically target enemies across the map.\n\n### 5. Sniping\n* Position yourself along long sightlines.\n* Equip a high-powered sniper rifle (e.g., bolt-action rifles).\n* Hold your breath (L3 on controller, Shift on PC) to eliminate scope sway.\n* Aim for the upper chest, neck, or head for a one-shot elimination.",
